odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:37615:20.190 fo:font-size
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:37625:In the OpenDocument XSL-compatible namespace, the fo:font-size attribute does not support absolute-size, inherit and relative-size values. 
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:37627:The fo:font-size attribute is usable with the following element: <style:text-properties> 16.29.29.
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:37629:The values of the fo:font-size attribute are a value of type positiveLength 18.3.27 or a value of type percent 18.3.24.
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:37653:20.193 fo:font-weight
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:37659:In the OpenDocument XSL-compatible namespace, the fo:font-weight attribute does not support bolder, inherit and lighter values.
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:37661:The fo:font-weight attribute is usable with the following element: <style:text-properties> 16.29.29.
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:37663:The values of the fo:font-weight attribute are normal, bold, 100, 200, 300, 400, 500, 600, 700, 800 or 900.
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:37803:20.206 fo:margin-bottom
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:37809:In the OpenDocument XSL-compatible namespace, the fo:margin-bottom attribute does not support the auto and inherit values.
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:37811:The fo:margin-bottom attribute is usable with the following elements: <style:graphic-properties> 17.21, <style:header-footer-properties> 17.5, <style:page-layout-properties> 17.2, <style:paragraph-properties> 17.6 and <style:table-properties> 17.15.
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:37813:The values of the fo:margin-bottom attribute are a value of type nonNegativeLength 18.3.21 or a value of type percent 18.3.24.
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:37839:20.209 fo:margin-top
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:37845:In the OpenDocument XSL-compatible namespace, the fo:margin-top attribute does not support the inherit value.
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:37847:The fo:margin-top attribute is usable with the following elements: <style:graphic-properties> 17.21, <style:header-footer-properties> 17.5, <style:page-layout-properties> 17.2, <style:paragraph-properties> 17.6 and <style:table-properties> 17.15.
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:37849:The values of the fo:margin-top attribute are a value of type nonNegativeLength 18.3.21 or a value of type percent 18.3.24.
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:37917:20.217 fo:padding
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:37921:The fo:padding attribute is usable with the following elements: <style:graphic-properties> 17.21, <style:header-footer-properties> 17.5, <style:page-layout-properties> 17.2, <style:paragraph-properties> 17.6 and <style:table-cell-properties> 17.18.
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:37923:The fo:padding attribute has the data type nonNegativeLength 18.3.21.
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:37925:20.218 fo:padding-bottom
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:37929:The fo:padding-bottom attribute is usable with the following elements: <style:graphic-properties> 17.21, <style:header-footer-properties> 17.5, <style:page-layout-properties> 17.2, <style:paragraph-properties> 17.6 and <style:table-cell-properties> 17.18.
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:37931:The fo:padding-bottom attribute has the data type nonNegativeLength 18.3.21.
